ZD2TOT   1.8 10470.0 -9.6
!     TOF-TWOTH of the bank
TWOTH    148.0
!       Sig-2     Sig-1     Sig-0
SIGMA    39.0 140.0 41.0
!       Gam-2     Gam-1     Gam-0
GAMMA    -14.0 26.5 -3.6
